Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.76,0:00:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what you're making. My dream time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:01:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest day I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wild, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't you move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife that I\Nwant, but you're weary once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life,\Nshine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just that\Nyou're gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Pika isn't moving anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for him to\Nlose his head like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's strike while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dopplomingo shall die by\Nmy hand. No mine. No mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those stubborn bastards don't\Nknow when to give up, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you bring out someone\Nworth fighting next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave it our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't stop the\Nfighters from the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little rats are really\Nfired up, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually think they have a\Nchance against the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're throwing their lives away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Fujitora arrives at\Nthe palace with his marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be ground up with a capital G.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that\Nwas Straw Hat's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They did stop Lord Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have four different enemies\Napproaching the palace right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,First, there's the\Ncompetitors from the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, there's Kidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, there's a second in\Ncommand of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, there's Straw Hat\NLuffy and that traitor Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pervert convert!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile Factory! Wow! Wow-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate me some gates and I'm\Ndownright disrespectful to doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of my radical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record, that crappy beam of yours\Nwouldn't even put a dent in the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To settle our score.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't I fought you enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A man's battle never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was an awesome\Nbird, senor! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk out from behind there\Nand surrender yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do that, then\Nwe'll come and get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't doing this for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't turn you in,\Nthen everyone's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want to bring an end to\Nthis nightmare as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't blame you for\Nwanting to end this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I certainly don't disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that's the case, then\NI need to move even faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let anyone get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is something\Nthat I must do first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't anyone tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy never stays anywhere for\Nmore than five minutes at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's freedom! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the pirates\Nknows how to roll, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like those pirates\Naren't giving up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little further, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're done with the\Nnet, perhaps I'll put it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye. Oopsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that big monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the royal palace\Ndoing way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the keys to lost handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to find it\Nthanks to my clairvoyance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to get it to Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why place your faith in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom must be broken\Ndown and its lies exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust them to end this false beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm betting everything\Non the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government has\Nproven untrustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave a title to Doflamingo,\Nwho ruled this kingdom with cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who caused our family so\Nmuch pain and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're blind to the\Nmeaning of justice and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,deaf to the voices of\Nthose they've victimized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't understand our rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,People in authority have the privilege\Nof only hearing what they want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But Straw Hat, he acts on the\Ngoodness inside his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he's a pirate,\Nhe hasn't lost his humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give Doflamingo the biggest\Nbeating of his life for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you guys all\Nlive to see it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This might change your mind, King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to look at this man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The one worth five stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland, a .k. a.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,God Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He risked his life and faced\Noff with trouble and sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He freed the people who had been enslaved
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,as toys and brought\Neveryone's memories back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the hero of our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And Luffy Land is his\Ncaptain, so he's super, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Usolanders, or rather, the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are the greatest hope\Nthat Dressrosa's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they're pirates, I'll trust\Nthem and cheer them on till the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I deliver the key to Lucy for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand here and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go. Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie dokie, sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see Mr. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll keep you nice and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just count on me! That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did you forget that you're\Non Doflamingo's wanted list?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,People will hunt you down. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,On the rooftops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cub and I know how to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,On the rooftops? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inhal, can I leave\Nthe factory in your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I already checked in\Nwith the scouting unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They said Fraland is fighting\NSenor Pink at the gate as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rush over and\Nhelp him any way we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take back Princess Mon\NCherie and all our friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, people, we've\Nsat around for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll complete our missions and meet\Nback here on the King's Plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He really does seem to\Nhave a mysterious power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did those muscle heads\Nmake it this far this fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to have\Nthousands of marines down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I could understand them\Ngetting past the troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but Bastille and Fujitoru\Nwere supposed to be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these guys crazy strong\Nand somehow we didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all they have to stop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Don Quixote family is weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll reach their boss in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Loopy has arrived\Nat the base of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's too tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They are so done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Colosseum group is on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Colosseum guys are moving too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, Dellinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like there's something\Nholding up the navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose if I asked\Nnicely, you'd move out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I stand with the Straw Hat Pirates and\Nwith those who have risen up to join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you or any of your friends\Nwant to lay a finger on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not taking another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving cover to pirates is not\Nthe Revolutionary Army's job?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now, and I think I can\Nsay that as Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,More so, I say that as a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Though that begs the question of\Nwho your dear sibling might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the flame flame\Nfruit, if you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what kind of power you got,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy's not gonna lose just\Ncause of one guy with a stupid pipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, don't shoot! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's finger should be that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These are claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate a log of fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit this has become quite the tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better leave this one to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hold on, Kitty, because I'm\Nabout to clip those claws of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the claws of a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Claws that liberate the innocent\Nand tear down oppressors like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He did that with his fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing broke in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, once these\Nclaws clutch a human skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,they can shatter it to pieces like an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is quite the quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought down a meteor,\Nbut come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the birdcage is likely to cut it\Ninto pieces before it gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have thought through that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a real mess of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know where\Nall the pieces went.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't harm any civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Warn us before you drop a\Nmeteor next time. It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought down a meteor. Real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize this could get terribly ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still getting used to my new powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky I was able to ward that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have caused quite the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned your duty as a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but be\Nreminded of Firefist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When he possessed your same power\Nbefore he died at Marineford,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,he said that Straw Hat Luffy was\Nhis brother, though not by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you also his brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All it takes to become brothers\Nis to share some sake. Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us exchanged a cup of sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in death, our bond will never break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say that's a rather troublesome\Nlittle family you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,An upstart with a massive bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A former commander of\Nthe Whitebeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.60,0:18:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Chief of Staff from\Nthe Revolutionary Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where I am, no\Nmatter what I'm doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I must abandon my duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment that Luffy needs\Nmy help, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo! Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've asked enough questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardly any point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I boring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I like a story better when I\Ncan enjoy it with a cup of sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Colosseum's Grim Reaper, but\Nwhy does it have Straw Hat on its back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep him away\Nfrom the palace, we're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll lose the game eventually!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave Moosey alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Moosey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Grim Reaper, coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cabbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I'll be taking the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was taking\Na shortcut for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta pick up the pace, Moosey, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everyone's catching up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's I-Rudan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play with you chumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some place to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks! We're losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you bunch of crab bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your paws off Straw Hat, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're breaking my heart, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm from Block C.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The same round as you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kelly Funk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your buddy god, Usopp,\Nreally saved my tail today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just being friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I found a shortcut you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.96,0:22:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take you straight to the sunflower\Nfield, right in front of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.09,0:22:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's leave cabbage in the dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I still gotta get these handcuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in reaching\Nthe palace if I can't fight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo will just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.36,0:22:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Work out. At least I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you're wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:23:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go back to that plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why to find the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't win this\Nfight, them we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See that? Shortcut. Told ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here and keep watch\Nfor you. Thanks. Sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Moosey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks for guarding the entrance, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Will do you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, we didn't need them, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, no looking back! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,To the sunflower field!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your snail, isn't it? Get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.01,0:24:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Luffy, the man who's\Ngonna be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.40,0:24:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Luffy. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're at the plateau.\NSame as before. And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.70,0:24:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the bottom of that other plateau,\Non the way to some sunflower field.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.68,0:24:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's four levels up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.04,0:24:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.95,0:24:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola found the key to the cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.18,0:24:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, awesome! Great. Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.36,0:24:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Leo, from the Tantana tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.68,0:24:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Real soon, Miss Rebecca,\Nthe big rooster guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And Robiland will be escorted\Nto your nearest location.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.84,0:24:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,at super high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.30,0:24:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we'll meet at the\Nsunflower field. That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, but how are you guys\Ngonna catch up with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.04,0:24:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You just worry about\Ngetting there. Peleck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.52,0:24:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.43,0:25:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.84,0:25:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, by coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.56,0:25:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off to the sunflower field, Moosey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.70,0:25:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.76,0:25:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end. Get out. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic, Moosey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.04,0:25:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
